Fetch problem statements in-page and tighten matching\n\n- The MV3 service worker has no DOMParser, so the old fetch-and-parse\n  path for the problem statement always threw and fell back to opening a\n  hidden tab. The content script now fetches and parses the problem page\n  on request (same origin, with cookies); the hidden tab remains only as\n  a fallback. Accepted source pages still use tabs because Codeforces\n  answers plain background requests for them with a bot challenge.\n- Remove src/lib/codeforces.ts, a duplicate scraper that nothing imported\n  apart from the broken problem-statement fetch, and the BM25 stub.\n- Share one languageFamily helper; it now distinguishes C from C++ and\n  JavaScript from Java, and the style score compares language families\n  so GNU C++17 and GNU C++20 count as the same language.\n- Fingerprint regexes use word boundaries (mapping/stacked/all no longer\n  register as map/stack/long long) and the zero/one edge signal only\n  fires when 0 or 1 is compared against.\n- All AI provider requests get a 90s timeout with a clear error.\n- Rebuild dist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"511507ecf37cf495e131c6013b974f6ea04855b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meoww-07/upSol/git/trees/511507ecf37cf495e131c6013b974f6ea04855b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meoww-07/upSol/git/commits/36b14cafd481cef6f0a291a898005cfdf9c74b34","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meoww-07/upSol/commits/36b14cafd481cef6f0a291a898005cfdf9c74b34","html_url":"https://github.com/meoww-07/upSol/commit/36b14cafd481cef6f0a291a898005cfdf9c74b34","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meoww-07/upSol/commits/36b14cafd481cef6f0a291a898005cfdf9c74b34/comments","author":{"login":"meoww-07","id":211807091,"node_id":"U_kgDODJ_rcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21180709